# The game log, with as many of Forge's log entry kinds as one short turn holds.
#
# Seat 0 (alice) lands at her own Declare Attackers Step with Grizzly Bears
# attacking (Forge fires the attack declaration itself) and six spells of hers
# already on the stack, bottom first:
#   Lightning Bolt -> bob                cast with a target, non-combat damage, life
#   Doom Blade -> Doomed Traveler        battlefield -> graveyard; bob's dies trigger, a token
#   Swords to Plowshares -> Savannah     battlefield -> exile; bob gains life
#   Hymn to Tourach -> bob               discards bob's whole hand: the Elves
#   Unsummon -> Llanowar Elves           a bounce (Forge logs its resolution)
#   Thought Scour -> bob                 bob mills two Forests; alice draws a Brainstorm
# Nobody can respond, so the stack resolves on its own; then bob blocks
# nothing, the Bears deal combat damage, and in Main Phase 2 alice plays a
# Mountain and casts Opt with her Island (mana, scry 1).
#
# bob's hand starts empty: the harness checks a scripted hand is still there
# once the board is up, and this one is discarded before it looks.
#
# Hidden from bob for the whole match: alice's Counterspell (never cast) and
# the Brainstorms in her library and hand.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=COMBAT_DECLARE_ATTACKERS
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=Counterspell;Mountain;Opt
humanbattlefield=Grizzly Bears|Attacking;Island
humanlibrary=Brainstorm;Brainstorm;Brainstorm;Brainstorm;Brainstorm;Brainstorm
humangraveyard=
humanputonstack=Lightning Bolt->ai;Doom Blade->201;Swords to Plowshares->202;Hymn to Tourach->ai;Unsummon->203;Thought Scour->ai
aihand=
